#| exercise: payoff_3_r
book_rule &lt;- function(loan_rate) {
  # your code here
}
book_rule(c(0.03, 0.05, 0.07))


case_when() handles a whole vector: loan_rate &gt; 0.06 ~ "Pay off", then loan_rate &gt;= 0.04 ~ "Do both", then .default = "Invest".


Solution. 
